WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.320
But this place grew after the war.

2
00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:19.160
People that moved here and came here and things began to . . .began to change on how you worked and looked at life and what you expected out of it and what you got out of it.

3
00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:20.580
It made a big difference.

4
00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:28.560
A lot of people who went in the war here from staying here, some of them . . . A lot of them,

5
00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:31.500
not some of them, a lot of them left here and went to the war.

6
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:34.800
After they come out, they never did come back here.

7
00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:35.980
Never did come back here.

8
00:00:35.980 --> 00:00:37.380
Where'd they go?

9
00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:39.140
Different places where they lived.

10
00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:42.460
California and New York.

11
00:00:42.460 --> 00:00:43.800
Where did they go?

12
00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:48.860
All of them that come out of the army, of the service, some of them never came back here to live.

13
00:00:48.860 --> 00:01:05.540
They had got a taste of life at its best and they was never coming back here to live or to work the fields.

14
00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:12.840
I was talking to a lady in Berkeley, California.

15
00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:30.560
She's from here, she's ninety, and we were talking about the places her grandchildren have never seen Westlake, Mossville, although their roots are here.

16
00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:40.080
They never came here to live like a second-class citizen.

17
00:01:40.080 --> 00:01:41.680
They never came.

18
00:01:41.680 --> 00:01:43.560
I don't know if they ever come to visit any of the people.

19
00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:51.380
Some of them did, but the ones I know they never did come back, come here.

20
00:01:51.380 --> 00:02:05.720
Now, some of them in this first buyout that Condea Vista [chemical company] did,

21
00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:13.260
some of them come back here because they were heirs to property and got that money and stuff.

22
00:02:13.260 --> 00:02:15.360
But they never did come back no more and stay here.
